//! `ddi_library::manifest::matched_profile`) is spread among charts of
//! similar difficulty, so a skill reads as its percentile among them
//! (`crate::radar::estimate_spokes`).
//!
//! Aggregates only, generated by the coordinating session's study from the
//! maintainer's local library (5,170 original Single charts with a
//! profile; `target/scratch/mp/notes/rating-relative-study.rs`, not kept in
