//! [`BAND_CENTERS`]) and every chart together ([`ALL`]), each skill's cost
//! at the percentiles [`KNOT_PCT`] among the charts whose cost for it is
//! over 0.1 points; `None` where fewer than 40 charts had one. No chart's
//! own data is in it. Pasted as generated: regenerate rather than edit.

